breaking overnight police in Germany say  a hostage situation at a large shopping  mall is over but it is not clear if the  suspect was captured police warned  people to avoid the neighborhood in the  eastern city of Dresden including the  popular Christmas Market an armed man  was said to be holding an undetermined  number of people there were reports that  the gunman first tried to break into a  radio station and opened fire he  reportedly then ran into the nearby  shopping mall a woman was found dead in  another part of the city police say her  son may be the suspected hostage taker
 

